msgstr "Koodhka fasalka"

msgid "Your display name"
msgstr "Magacaaga muuqda"

msgid "A nickname or made-up name is fine — no need to use your real name."
msgstr "Magac naanays ah ama magac la sameeyay waa hagaag - looma baahna inaad isticmaasho magacaaga dhabta ah."

msgid "Return code (optional)"
msgstr "Koodhka soo laabashada (ikhtiyaari)"

