msgstr "Waan ku xannibanahay"

msgid "I am stuck. Ask me one clarifying question, then give me one small next step."
msgstr "Waan ku xannibanahay. I weydii hal su'aal oo caddayn ah ka dibna i sii hal tallaabo oo yar."

msgid "How to ask better"
msgstr "Sideen si fiican u codsadaa caawimo"

msgid "Help me write a clear help request: what I expected, what happened, and what I already tried."
msgstr "Iga caawi inaan qoro codsi caawimo oo cad: waxa aan filayay, waxa dhacay, iyo waxa aan hore u tijaabiyay."
